[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12252.19, "timestamp": "03:24:12", "text": "いいえ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12259.91, "timestamp": "03:24:19", "text": "大丈夫。大丈夫。大丈夫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12262.51, "timestamp": "03:24:22", "text": "矢印。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12266.229, "timestamp": "03:24:26", "text": "えっと、彼に何を伝えるべきか、どうやって伝えればいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12270.469, "timestamp": "03:24:30", "text": "君を蘇らせてあげるよ。彼に戦わせてやろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12274.87, "timestamp": "03:24:34", "text": "彼はあなたの持ち物を全部盗んだのですか？うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12286.11, "timestamp": "03:24:46", "text": "わかった。あなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12288.19, "timestamp": "03:24:48", "text": "何をしているの？"}]